su name loop be refinery def
exists su name listen ob la su name transcript from filename "artifacts/hear/talk-loop-input.wav" be hear do ko be platform ya
exists su name draft from ve name listen ob la su name lines ob text "Reply in one short sentence." for name mind to name text mind-out be write do ko be platform ya
exists su name speak from ve name draft ob la su name audio ob name mind-out to filename "artifacts/say/talk-loop-smoke.wav" be say do ko be platform ya
prah
